      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تراغبوا فِيِه</span></b>  <i>They vied, one with another, in
desiring it;</i> or <i>they desired it with emulation;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنافسوا فيه</span>. (A and TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نفس</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تراغب المَكَانُ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>The place was,</i> or <i>became, wide,</i>
or <i>ample.</i> (TA. [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَغُبَ</span>.])

